 ## Operating characteristics
-*   **Time Complexity:** Same as standard Marching Cubes, $O(N)$ where $N$ is the number of voxels, as it uses the same lookup-based approach [S1].
-*   **Memory Complexity:** Requires storage for Lengyel's lookup tables. The size is comparable to the standard tables [S2, unofficial].
-*   **Strengths:** Produces manifold meshes with regular connectivity (max valence 6), which is beneficial for compression and subsequent processing [S1]. Fixes holes in terrain generation [S2, unofficial].
-*   **Limitations:** The specific topology changes may not be suitable for all scientific visualization applications where the original MC topology is preferred [S1].
